WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.744
[Nervous Staccato Guitar Riff and Industrial Pulse Intro]

00:00:45.744 --> 00:00:50.500
A song I've never heard before

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:56.500
Just kicked down a forgotten door

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:02.748
A tidal wave of pure relief

00:01:02.948 --> 00:01:08.000
A moment's break from all the grief

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:14.410
You're by my side, a steady hand

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:21.416
In this strange and foreign land

00:01:21.677 --> 00:01:25.500
But underneath the happy tears

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:29.804
Are all the ghosts of these long years

00:01:33.582 --> 00:01:37.444
I'm trying to find my way back home

00:01:37.484 --> 00:01:40.000
Through the static and the chrome

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.827
The '80s beat is in my soul

00:01:42.827 --> 00:01:47.500
But the darkness still has its control

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:51.000
A song of homecoming in my head

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:55.000
For all the words I haven't said

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:59.000
I'm trying to get back to the light

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.097
With all of my remaining might

00:02:02.097 --> 00:02:09.743
[Instrumental Interlude]

00:02:09.743 --> 00:02:17.500
I see the planes outside the glass

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:24.000
And pray this fragile feeling's built to last

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:29.500
Your quiet strength, your gentle grace

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:36.000
The only safety in this place

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:42.068
But every echo, every sound

00:02:42.308 --> 00:02:48.000
On this unholy, hollow ground

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:52.500
Pulls me back to that dark room

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:56.892
And the silence of a living tomb

00:03:01.277 --> 00:03:04.978
I'm trying to find my way back home

00:03:05.018 --> 00:03:07.500
Through the static and the chrome

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.359
The '80s beat is in my soul

00:03:10.359 --> 00:03:15.000
But the darkness still has its control

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.500
A song of homecoming in my head

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:22.500
For all the words I haven't said

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:26.942
I'm trying to get back to the light

00:03:27.102 --> 00:03:31.724
With all of my remaining might

00:03:31.724 --> 00:04:28.166
[Soaring Electric Guitar Solo]

00:04:28.166 --> 00:04:32.000
Almost home... Almost free...

00:04:32.000 --> 00:05:00.000
[Instrumental Outro Build]

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:09.880
Almost me...
